abstract: >-
  We simulate shared mobility services (e.g. ride hailing,
  vehicle sharing), the infrastructure they use (e.g.
  charging), and the markets that link them to users (e.g.,
  Mobility-as-a-Service) and to each other (e.g. charging
  slot auctions).
